{"type":"decision.logged","title":"Bundle-aware path resolution for static UI assets","rationale":"The esbuild bundler compiles all source files into dist/cli.js, so __dirname resolves to dist/ instead of the original dist/mcp/ or dist/commands/ subdirectories. Paths like ../../ui/dist (written assuming unbundled output) resolve incorrectly to /www/html/ui/dist. Fix: use ../ui/dist and ../ui from dist/ context.","filePath":".project/decisions/2026-02-21-ADR-bundle-aware-path-resolution-for-static-.md","id":"1771633179319-bbng","timestamp":"2026-02-21T00:19:39.319Z","actor":"rmarsigli@gmail.com"}
{"type":"decision.logged","title":"Rewrite AIPIM as an Event-Sourced MCP Server (v2.0)","rationale":"v1 clipboard workflow was incompatible with MCP tooling. Markdown files as source of truth are racy, not queryable, and not auditable. Replaced with append-only events.jsonl + SQLite projection + Hono MCP server. Full details in ADR-009.","filePath":".project/decisions/2026-02-21-ADR-rewrite-aipim-as-an-event-sourced-mcp-se.md","id":"1771633633910-ne7o","timestamp":"2026-02-21T00:27:13.910Z","actor":"rmarsigli@gmail.com"}
